#!/usr/bin/env python3
# Walwrite: a simple Markdown and text editor in the pywal colors.
#
# Usage: walwrite [FILE...]
#
# Several files open at once (switch with the sidebar, Ctrl+Tab, or Ctrl+PageUp/PageDown), and
# the open files come back the next time it starts. Files that have been saved once are saved
# again automatically a moment after each edit; untitled documents are kept as drafts. Press Alt
# for the menu bar, Ctrl+E for the rendered Markdown, and Ctrl+? for every shortcut.

